---
source: crates/pinmap-cli/tests/pin.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
pin     PA5
pad     30
port    A5
use     SPI1.SCK
net     IMU_SCK
config  speed=very_high
origin  board/revb.pinasg.json  peripherals.SPI1.signals.SCK

FUNCTION  MUX     ASSIGNED
SPI1.SCK  AF5     yes
TIM2.CH1  AF1
DAC.OUT2  analog
